# Meson build file for differentiated CBLAS sources
# Same layout as BLAS/meson.build: include/ + src/ for _d and _dv modes
# All files in include/ (cblas_d.h, cblas_f77_d.h, cblas_dv.h, cblas_f77_dv.h,
# DIFFSIZESF.inc, DIFFSIZESC.inc, DIFFSIZES.f90) are used via
# libdiffcblas_include = include_directories('CBLAS/include') in root meson.build.

